label "Unbounded agent loops anti-pattern diagram"
canvas 460 250
box think 30 30 90 40 "think"
box act 170 30 90 40 "act"
box obs 100 120 90 40 "observe"
arrow think act
arrow act obs
arrow obs think
text 145 186 "no cap · no budget · no done test" size=11
box gate 290 90 156 60 "exit gate|step cap · budget · done?" acc
box stop 316 180 104 40 "stop|or escalate"
arrow obs gate dashed
arrow gate stop
text 238 118 "missing" size=10
note "the loop is fine; running it without a gate is the anti-pattern"
